**Found it.** Only 3 of 625 cases actually failed, all in `order totals`. `orderTotal` in `src/pricing.js` charged tax on the full price instead of the discounted price. It taxes the discounted amount now. All 625 tests pass.

```js
function orderTotal(cents, discountPct, taxRate) {
  const discounted = applyDiscount(cents, discountPct);
  return applyTax(discounted, taxRate);
}
```
